---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="What DNAthletic is, and who's behind it."
>
  <section class="article">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <span class="kicker">About</span>
      <header class="article-header">
        <h1>Training, taken seriously.</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>DNAthletic</strong> is a writing project about strength and
          conditioning — and the technology that's making training measurable.
        </p>
        <p>
          The premise is simple: the best training decisions come from combining
          hard-won gym experience with what the science and the sensors actually
          say. Not one or the other. This site is where those two worlds get
          connected in plain language.
        </p>

        <h2>What this is not</h2>
        <p>
          It's not a supplement store, a coaching funnel, or a feed of hot takes.
          Posts are occasional and specific, and they try to be honest about what
          we know versus what we're guessing.
        </p>

        <h2>Who's writing</h2>
        <p>
          Hi — I'm the person behind DNAthletic. <em>(Replace this with your own
          story: your background, why strength &amp; conditioning, what you're
          exploring on the tech side.)</em>
        </p>

        <p>
          Want new posts in your inbox? A newsletter signup is coming soon. For
          now, you can <a href="/rss.xml">subscribe via RSS</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
